---
title: "circuit_break (Current Finance: Admin)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_trigger: trigger_circuit_break or discharge?
    q_check_trigger --> q_trigger: trigger_circuit_break
    q_check_trigger --> q_discharge: discharge_circuit_break
    q_trigger --> q_check_already: is_circuit_break == true?
    q_check_already --> q_error_already: already under circuit break
    q_check_already --> q_set_true: not under circuit break
    q_error_already --> [*]: abort already_under_circuit_break
    q_set_true --> [*]: circuit_break = true
    q_discharge --> q_check_not: is_circuit_break == false?
    q_check_not --> q_error_not: not under circuit break
    q_check_not --> q_set_false: under circuit break
    q_error_not --> [*]: abort not_under_circuit_break
    q_set_false --> [*]: circuit_break = false

    note right of q_check_trigger
        INV-001: circuit_break blocks deposit, withdraw, borrow, repay, liquidate, flash_loan, enter_market
        INV-002: only admin can trigger/discharge circuit break
        INV-003: toggle is idempotent-safe (cannot trigger twice)
    end note
